From b9de0cb3fa6c0000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Linxuan <me@black-desk.cn>
Date: Wed, 4 Jun 2026 16:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Declare transitive deps in rime.pc for static linking

When building a static librime, the linker needs all transitive
dependencies.  Add Libs.private to rime.pc.in so that
`pkg-config --static rime` returns the full link chain.

stdc++ / c++ is platform-dependent (Linux: -lstdc++, macOS: -lc++),
so it is intentionally excluded here and handled by the consumer
(e.g. build.rs with cfg(target_os)).

Signed-off-by: Chen Linxuan <me@black-desk.cn>
---
 rime.pc.in | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/rime.pc.in b/rime.pc.in
index 3a3e65c51649..2b8e6bfb5238 100644
--- a/rime.pc.in
+++ b/rime.pc.in
@@ -8,3 +8,5 @@ pkgdatadir=@pkgdatadir@
 Version: @rime_version@
 Cflags: -I${includedir}
 Libs: -L${libdir} -lrime
+Libs.private: -lboost_filesystem -lboost_locale -lboost_thread -lboost_chrono -lboost_atomic -lboost_container -lboost_date_time -lboost_charconv -ldarts -lglog -lgflags -lleveldb -llua -lmarisa -lopencc -lyaml-cpp
+
--
2.47.2
